# results are never ignored. every run artifact is committed - raw responses, per-run logs, the lot -
# so any number in the paper traces to a file in git. bulk artifacts too large for a repo also go to
# the hugging face dataset via scripts/sync_results.py; git stays the source of truth for the rest.
!results/**
!results/**/*.log

